<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-songshu" book-id="b-songshu-058" chapter-id="c-songshu-058-wanghui-opening-and-death" source-id="s-songshu-058-wanghui-opening-and-death-ws1996691">
  <p id="c-songshu-058-wanghui-opening-and-death:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-058-wanghui-opening-and-death:p001:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAEEB">王惠</persName>字<persName id="c-songshu-058-wanghui-opening-and-death:p001:m0003" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAEEB">令明</persName>，琅邪臨沂人，太保<persName id="c-songshu-058-wanghui-opening-and-death:p001:m0014" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAA">弘</persName>從祖弟也。祖<persName id="c-songshu-058-wanghui-opening-and-death:p001:m0021" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAE">劭</persName>，車騎將軍。父<persName id="c-songshu-058-wanghui-opening-and-death:p001:m0029" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAEE">默</persName>，左光祿大夫。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-058-wanghui-opening-and-death:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-058-wanghui-opening-and-death:p002:m0000" ref="7r6_k52_qji_ABAAEEB">惠</persName>又曰：「亦復何用食為。」其標寄如此。元嘉三年，卒，時年四十二。追贈太常。無子。</p>
</text>
